ly I thought this is really  unprecedented the last time that a that  a leader from another country even an  out you know an ally whatever does it  doesn't matter came and with supporting  the opposition presidential candidate I  thought this is probably is true it's a  function of no cheaper air travel and  things like Twitter and the Internet  you  [Music]

